{"repositoryId":1341223314,"availability":"available","full":"turky4500/binance-trading-dashboard","name":"binance-trading-dashboard","description":"Automated read-only Binance spot trading-opportunities dashboard — deterministic multi-timeframe analysis, refreshed every 15 min by GitHub Actions, published on GitHub Pages.","category":"Other","language":"Python","stars":3,"forks":0,"created":"2026-08-20T23:29:55Z","updated":"2026-10-12T19:07:41Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://turky4500.github.io/binance-trading-dashboard/","topics":[],"demo":"https://turky4500.github.io/binance-trading-dashboard/","color":"#25392f","ink":"#d1e5c5","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-12T19:08:20.544Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-12T19:08:20.544Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-12T19:08:20.544Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-12T19:08:20.544Z","stars":3,"forks":0}],"technologies":["Python"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["لوحة تحكم تلقائية لرصد أفضل فرص التداول على Binance Spot — تحليل فقط، بدون أي تداول.","A fully automated, read-only trading-opportunity dashboard for Binance Spot. It pulls live public market data, runs deterministic multi-timeframe technical analysis, publishes only high-quality setups (Entry / SL / TP / R:R / Score), tracks their lifecycle, keeps a performance history, and ships everything as a free static site on GitHub Pages — refreshed every 15 minutes by GitHub Actions.","⚠️ This project never places orders. No trading permissions, no withdrawals, no API keys. It is analysis software, not a trading bot."],"features":["🌐 Live Binance spot data (public endpoints only — zero secrets required)","⚡ Real-time prices in the dashboard via Binance public WebSocket streams — prices flash green/red on every change (degrades gracefully to pipeline prices when the stream is unavailable)","📈 Multi-timeframe analysis: 15m / 1h / 4h / 1d with EMA 20/50/200, RSI, MACD, ATR, VWAP, SuperTrend (10,3), volume, structure","🎯 Complete trade plans: entry zone, SL (ATR + structure based), TP1/TP2/TP3, R:R, invalidation level","🏆 Configurable 100-point scoring with per-component breakdown"],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/turky4500/binance-trading-dashboard/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"4b0c80eabd581ed09d992da3472f49e7374dc84a728a3370cb0d04c74390cdc1","extractedAt":"2026-10-12T19:08:20.649Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-12T19:08:20.649Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"لوحة تحكم تلقائية لرصد أفضل فرص التداول على Binance Spot — تحليل فقط، بدون أي تداول.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/turky4500/binance-trading-dashboard/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[{"kind":"api_key","status":"required","text":"The dashboard uses only public market-data endpoints (/api/v3/ticker/24hr, /api/v3/klines, /api/v3/exchangeInfo, /api/v3/ticker/bookTicker) which require no API key at all.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/turky4500/binance-trading-dashboard/blob/main/README.md"}],"fingerprint":"4b0c80eabd581ed09d992da3472f49e7374dc84a728a3370cb0d04c74390cdc1","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/turky4500/binance-trading-dashboard/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-12T19:08:20.649Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-12T19:07:41Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/turky4500/binance-trading-dashboard/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-12T19:08:20.650Z","hash":"4b0c80eabd581ed09d992da3472f49e7374dc84a728a3370cb0d04c74390cdc1","originalBytes":18939,"storedBytes":18939,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["data","binance","dashboard","every","github","live","tp1","api","only","public","setups","entry","hit","market","quant","setup","analysis","atr","pages","score","spot","triggered","git","min","minutes","pct","pipeline","supertrend","timeframe","trading","volume","deterministic","minimum","never","new","telegram","actions","distance","expired","free","key","lifecycle","price","ready","runs","scoring","stopped","tp2","tp3","zone","agent","agent.max","breadth",